@archive 0022
@size 12

script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"엘리트 위저드는 완전히\n다르군…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"다른 녀석들보다 훨씬 많은\n크림슨을 뿜어냈어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"그리고 지난번 전투에서\n필요한 록맨의 데이터도\n전부 수집했어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"뭘 알아냈지…?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"록맨에게는 현재 수준을\n뛰어넘는 엄청난 잠재력이\n아직 남아 있어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 호시카와 스바루의 위저드,\n워록이 그 열쇠라는 사실도\n알아냈지…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"역시 예상대로야…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"워록의\n데이터는?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"그것도 전부 손에 넣었어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이제 킹 씨도 더는\n문제없겠군."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	bgmStop
		fadeTime = 1
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"잭!!\n티아 씨!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"그래서 크림슨을 모으고 있었군…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"이렇게 많이 모을 수 있었던 건\n너희 덕분이야…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"대체 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는지\n말해!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"우린 네 적이야…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"딜러의 일원이지…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"역시 사실이었군…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"딜러의 수장인 킹 씨의 명령으로\n우리는"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"코다마 타운 초등학교에 전학해서\n록맨을 조사했어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"너에 대한 데이터를\n얻기 위해 위저드들을\n폭주시켰지…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"잭…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"동시에 전투에서 방출된\n크림슨도 전부"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"수집했어\n."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"왜 크림슨을…?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"킹 씨가 원하니까…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 우리에게도\n아주 중요한 거야…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"이제 데이터는 너무 많다 싶을\n정도로 모였어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"크림슨도 너희 덕분에\n차고 넘칠 만큼\n모였고."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이제 우리의 임무는\n끝난 셈이지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"…그러니 너는 더 이상\n쓸모가 없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"이런 일을 벌여 놓고\n그냥 집에 돌려보낼 순 없지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"정의의 영웅, 록맨을\n쓰러뜨릴 수밖에\n없겠네…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"우리 위저드들도\n이 일을 하고 싶어 해…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"너희 위저드들이…?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
