script 5 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"비르고…!\n코르버스…!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"아는 사이야, 워록?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"저 녀석들도 외계인이야…\nFM인이지…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"지구 역사상 가장\n사악하고 강력한\n범죄자들이야…!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"범죄자… FM 행성 출신이라고…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"수많은 세계를\n파괴한 장본인들이라고\n들었어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Corvus
	"어이…\n왜 그래, 워록!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"우리를 만나서 기쁘지 않아?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"고향에서는 네 힘이\n유명했잖아,"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하지만 위저드가 되더니\n실력이 녹슬어 버린\n모양이네!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"크르르…!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Virgo
	"키야하하하하!!\n무서워서 떨고 있냐!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"믿을 수가 없군.\n워록이 우리를 무서워하고 있어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"잘 봐, 코르버스!\n다리가 후들거리고 있잖아!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"키야하하하하!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Corvus
	"고향에서 네가 우리와\n싸우려고 덤볐던 거 기억나?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그때마다 우리가 널\n흙바닥에 처박아 줬잖아!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 뒤로 아주\n조금쯤은\n강해졌겠지!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"그만해!!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
